WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.934
-Here at "Late Night,"
every night I deliver

00:00:03.934 --> 00:00:05.601
a monologue made up
of jokes written by

00:00:05.601 --> 00:00:06.901
a diverse team of writers.

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:09.601
As a result, a lot of jokes
come across my desk that,

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:12.200
due to my being
a straight White male,

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.234
would be difficult
for me to deliver.

00:00:14.234 --> 00:00:16.868
We don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them,

00:00:16.868 --> 00:00:18.567
so we'd like to share them
with you now

00:00:18.567 --> 00:00:20.968
in a segment called
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:20.968 --> 00:00:23.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.534 --> 00:00:25.734
[ Tape rips ]

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:28.601
These are two of our writers,
Amber and Jenny.

00:00:28.601 --> 00:00:30.334
-I'm Black.
-And I'm gay.

00:00:30.334 --> 00:00:32.567
-And we're both women.
-And I'm not.

00:00:32.567 --> 00:00:33.734
So here's how it works.

00:00:33.734 --> 00:00:35.534
I'll read the setups
to these jokes,

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:38.133
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:39.400
Here we go.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.367
A queer website recently
published an article titled

00:00:42.367 --> 00:00:45.300
"Ten Lesbian Books
You Need to Read this Fall."

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.167
-A lesbian book is like
a straight book,

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:48.934
except it has a climax.

00:00:48.934 --> 00:00:50.767
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.767 --> 00:00:53.234
[ Applause ]

00:00:53.234 --> 00:00:55.934
-16 Black candidates
are major party nominees

00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:57.667
for Senate
and governor this fall.

00:00:57.667 --> 00:00:58.934
-So do those candidates,

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:02.100
I say get ready to be
called each others names.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:03.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.901 --> 00:01:05.901
-Andrew, do you ever
get mistaken for anyone?

00:01:05.901 --> 00:01:07.100
-Yeah.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.200
Laurence Fishburne.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.501
-Oh.
-Hmm.

00:01:10.501 --> 00:01:11.767
-Oh, yeah.

00:01:11.767 --> 00:01:13.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:15.501
According to the
American Medical Association,

00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:18.367
lesbian medical students
may have higher rates of burnout

00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:19.767
than straight students.

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:21.601
-Because it's tough to do
all that studying

00:01:21.601 --> 00:01:23.901
and take care of five dogs.

00:01:23.901 --> 00:01:25.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.567 --> 00:01:28.367
-Now, Jenny,
why do lesbians like dogs?

00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:31.868
-Because they love relationships
that last 15 to 17 years.

00:01:31.868 --> 00:01:34.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.367 --> 00:01:37.067
-"Lord of the Rings" fans
have expressed anger

00:01:37.067 --> 00:01:38.267
that the new spinoff,

00:01:38.267 --> 00:01:40.934
based on the books,
features Black hobbits.

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:43.033
-A Black hobbit
is like a White hobbit,

00:01:43.033 --> 00:01:45.267
except your girlfriend
wants to [bleep] it.

00:01:45.267 --> 00:01:47.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.467 --> 00:01:53.901
-But why?

00:01:53.901 --> 00:01:55.767
-Because it's 6'2."

00:01:55.767 --> 00:01:57.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.801 --> 00:02:03.667
-A forklift driver is hoping
to be the UK's first lesbian

00:02:03.667 --> 00:02:05.000
Miss Great Britain.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.834
-Officials suspected
she was a lesbian

00:02:06.834 --> 00:02:09.534
when her talent
was operating a forklift.

00:02:09.534 --> 00:02:11.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.234 --> 00:02:13.133
-A man from Philadelphia
walked more than

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:15.300
400 miles along
the Underground Railroad

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:17.868
to celebrate Harriet Tubman's
200th birthday.

00:02:17.868 --> 00:02:19.133
-Said Harriet Tubman,

00:02:19.133 --> 00:02:21.534
"I did that so you
wouldn't have to."

00:02:21.534 --> 00:02:22.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.801 --> 00:02:24.200
Amber, what did you do
to celebrate

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.501
Harriet Tubman's birthday?

00:02:25.501 --> 00:02:27.334
-I did just what she would
want me to do,

00:02:27.334 --> 00:02:30.067
not a goddamn thing.

00:02:30.067 --> 00:02:31.634
-Do you really think
that's what she'd want?

00:02:31.634 --> 00:02:34.501
-Yes. Take it from me,
Laurence Fishburne.

00:02:34.501 --> 00:02:37.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.701 --> 00:02:39.934
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:39.934 --> 00:02:42.033
The White House
recently hosted a roundtable

00:02:42.033 --> 00:02:43.634
with a group of lesbian leaders.

00:02:43.634 --> 00:02:45.400
-"Oh, [bleep].
My ex is here,"

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:48.367
said all of them.

00:02:48.367 --> 00:02:50.801
-During a recent briefing,
White House Press Secretary

00:02:50.801 --> 00:02:52.834
Karine Jean-Pierre
mistakenly referred

00:02:52.834 --> 00:02:55.000
to Supreme Court
Justice Clarence Thomas

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.067
as Justice Thompson.

00:02:57.067 --> 00:02:59.834
-She meant to say
Uncle Thompson.

00:02:59.834 --> 00:03:03.834
-The website Autostraddle
recently published

00:03:03.834 --> 00:03:06.234
an article titled
"How to Dress Like

00:03:06.234 --> 00:03:08.934
the Main Character
in a Lesbian Rom Com."

00:03:08.934 --> 00:03:10.701
-The article is just one photo.

00:03:10.701 --> 00:03:12.267
-Oh, come on.

00:03:12.267 --> 00:03:14.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.734 --> 00:03:17.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:20.467 --> 00:03:21.501
-The flannel fits.

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:23.167
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.167 --> 00:03:24.734
-Jenny. Hey, Jenny?
-Mm-hmm.

00:03:24.734 --> 00:03:27.367
-What's the difference
between a lesbian rom com

00:03:27.367 --> 00:03:28.634
and a straight rom com?

00:03:28.634 --> 00:03:32.367
-In straight rom coms,
everyone survives.

00:03:32.367 --> 00:03:34.267
-Hey, guys.
Jenny Hagel here.

00:03:34.267 --> 00:03:36.601
I don't know if you know this,
but in lesbian movies

00:03:36.601 --> 00:03:40.234
and TV shows, the lesbians
always die, every time.

00:03:40.234 --> 00:03:43.100
[ Whispering ] I might not live
to the end of this segment.

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:45.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:48.767
-Hey. Hey, Seth?
Why don't you tell one?

00:03:48.767 --> 00:03:50.234
No, guys, I could not.

00:03:50.234 --> 00:03:51.501
-Oh, come on.

00:03:51.501 --> 00:03:52.634
-I just don't feel like

00:03:52.634 --> 00:03:53.901
if I tell one
it'll end well.

00:03:53.901 --> 00:03:56.067
-Please, do one?
-Come on, do one.

00:03:56.067 --> 00:03:59.033
-I trust you both. You're my
friends, and I trust you.

00:03:59.033 --> 00:04:01.033
A Massachusetts woman
is raising money

00:04:01.033 --> 00:04:02.968
to open a new lesbian bar
in Boston.

00:04:02.968 --> 00:04:05.467
Because if there's one place
lesbians love to go,

00:04:05.467 --> 00:04:07.234
it's Beantown.

00:04:07.234 --> 00:04:10.100
-Seth!

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.400
Gross!

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.267
-I barely get it.

00:04:13.267 --> 00:04:17.801
[ Laughter ]

00:04:17.801 --> 00:04:19.701
We're at work right now.
-I'm tried to go once.

00:04:19.701 --> 00:04:20.701
I got super lost.

00:04:20.701 --> 00:04:22.667
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:22.667 --> 00:04:25.033
-No man knows
how to locate Beantown.

00:04:25.033 --> 00:04:28.701
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:31.400
-But Google Maps
just told me to go home.

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:33.801
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.801 --> 00:04:35.200
Alright, you know what?
I'll try again.

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:36.901
-You will?
-Against my better judgment.

00:04:36.901 --> 00:04:38.400
-Okay.

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:41.067
-Disney's upcoming live action
version of "The Little Mermaid"

00:04:41.067 --> 00:04:43.167
will feature
a black actress playing Ariel.

00:04:43.167 --> 00:04:44.834
She'll be breaking barriers
as the first

00:04:44.834 --> 00:04:46.067
Black woman who can swim.

00:04:46.067 --> 00:04:49.067
-[ Gasps ]
How dare you?

00:04:49.067 --> 00:04:51.501
-Stop acting like
you didn't write this!

00:04:51.501 --> 00:04:52.567
-I am shocked!

00:04:52.567 --> 00:04:54.501
You should be
ashamed of yourself!

00:04:54.501 --> 00:04:57.667
Black women
and lesbians are liars!

00:04:57.667 --> 00:04:59.767
♪♪

00:04:59.767 --> 00:05:02.033
[ Tape rips ]

00:05:02.033 --> 00:05:03.634
Oh, no!
-[ Gasping ]

00:05:03.634 --> 00:05:05.167
-Oh, no!

00:05:05.167 --> 00:05:07.968
-My friend, my gay, gay friend!
[ Sobbing ]

00:05:07.968 --> 00:05:09.667
-Oh, and for the best.

00:05:09.667 --> 00:05:11.300
It's for the best.

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:14.100
Amber Ruffin and Jenny Hagel,
everybody.

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.100
-I'm okay.
-Hey, you guys.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.234
This is very important.
Watch these two

00:05:18.234 --> 00:05:20.434
on "The Amber Ruffin Show,"
which returns

00:05:20.434 --> 00:05:22.000
for a season three next Friday,

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.667
September 30th on Peacock

00:05:23.667 --> 00:05:25.901
with Guess Hillary
and Chelsea Clinton.

00:05:25.901 --> 00:05:28.067
We'll be right back
Ana de Armas, everybody.

